{"3335510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Limbot", "steam_appid": 3335510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Limbot, the ultimate physics-based city stomping experience where up to 4 players must attempt to pilot a person dressed as a giant cardboard robot! Embrace the chaos in a paper-craft metropolis designed to be crushed, smashed, and destroyed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stomp Through the City!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/19db2e0739cbf9298be4a6027a0971c7.poster.avif?t=1786525232\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/19db2e0739cbf9298be4a6027a0971c7.webm?t=1786525232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/19db2e0739cbf9298be4a6027a0971c7.mp4?t=1786525232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stomp, kick, and punch your way to completing wacky objectives set in a fully destructible cardboard world, where every building, obstacle, and enemy can be bashed to pieces or flattened into pulp! Smash down skyscrapers, face-off against paper foes, and take down the biggest (and silliest) crafted bosses this world has ever seen…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/ff202011ce488d45dc7f111b027184e5.poster.avif?t=1786525232\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/ff202011ce488d45dc7f111b027184e5.webm?t=1786525232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/ff202011ce488d45dc7f111b027184e5.mp4?t=1786525232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power-up with Duct Tape and Soda Cans!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go full DIY and unlock upgrades to customise your robot such as strapping a soda can to your leg for a handy speed boost, wooden spoons to give your Karate chops some added range, or slap on some stickers to add some extra style. Mix and match upgrades to make your perfect robot!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controlling a Robot has never been easier!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/bc221f72a99a0d39ea340c3ca952cff7.poster.avif?t=1786525232\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/bc221f72a99a0d39ea340c3ca952cff7.webm?t=1786525232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/bc221f72a99a0d39ea340c3ca952cff7.mp4?t=1786525232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive controls make moving limbs simple and accessible to players of all ages and abilities. All you need to do is figure out how to work together... good luck with that! Oh, one more thing, if the robot trips, it's definitely your teammate’s fault!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Limbot, the ultimate physics-based city stomping experience where up to 4 players must attempt to pilot a person dressed as a giant cardboard robot! Embrace the chaos in a paper-craft metropolis designed to be crushed, smashed, and destroyed!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stomp Through the City!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/19db2e0739cbf9298be4a6027a0971c7.poster.avif?t=1786525232\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/19db2e0739cbf9298be4a6027a0971c7.webm?t=1786525232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/19db2e0739cbf9298be4a6027a0971c7.mp4?t=1786525232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stomp, kick, and punch your way to completing wacky objectives set in a fully destructible cardboard world, where every building, obstacle, and enemy can be bashed to pieces or flattened into pulp! Smash down skyscrapers, face-off against paper foes, and take down the biggest (and silliest) crafted bosses this world has ever seen…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/ff202011ce488d45dc7f111b027184e5.poster.avif?t=1786525232\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/ff202011ce488d45dc7f111b027184e5.webm?t=1786525232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/ff202011ce488d45dc7f111b027184e5.mp4?t=1786525232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Power-up with Duct Tape and Soda Cans!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go full DIY and unlock upgrades to customise your robot such as strapping a soda can to your leg for a handy speed boost, wooden spoons to give your Karate chops some added range, or slap on some stickers to add some extra style. Mix and match upgrades to make your perfect robot!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controlling a Robot has never been easier!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/bc221f72a99a0d39ea340c3ca952cff7.poster.avif?t=1786525232\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/bc221f72a99a0d39ea340c3ca952cff7.webm?t=1786525232\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/extras/bc221f72a99a0d39ea340c3ca952cff7.mp4?t=1786525232\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intuitive controls make moving limbs simple and accessible to players of all ages and abilities. All you need to do is figure out how to work together... good luck with that! Oh, one more thing, if the robot trips, it's definitely your teammate’s fault!</p>", "short_description": "Limbot is a super silly, 3D platformer where you individually control the limbs of a giant cardboard robot! Master all four limbs in solo or embrace the chaos (and camaraderie) with friends, using Steam Remote Play Together or local co-op, in this fully destructible cardboard world!", "supported_languages": "English, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, French, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/597c1abdd1e612279780b4d74327874de1aca0ec/header.jpg?t=1786525232", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3335510/cdf481cd187c12bdb2cb40629fcaba3013221249/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786525232", "capsule